#!/usr/bin/env bash
cat <<'H'
SG console — a real shell. Extra commands:
  tabbed           switch to tabbed mode (Ctrl+Shift+T)
  fullscreen       toggle full screen (F11)
  new-tab          open a new tab in tabbed mode
  tall | small     extend the console up / minimise it
  float            pop the console out / dock it again
  lock [--quick]   lock the laptop (boot clip → title screen; --quick skips the clip)
  phone            open the Phone Trigger (Super+P)
  worldline        show the divergence number
  date · whoami · clear · el psy kongroo

Shortcuts:
  Alt+P / Alt+C    toggle console
  Ctrl+Shift+T     open new tab
  Ctrl+Shift+W     close active tab
  Ctrl+PageUp/Down switch tabs (also Alt+1..9, Ctrl+Tab)
  F11              toggle fullscreen
  Ctrl+Shift+F     search in terminal scrollback
  Ctrl++ / Ctrl+-  zoom font in / out (Ctrl+0 resets)
  Ctrl+Shift+C / V copy / paste (Shift+Insert / Ctrl+Insert)
  Ctrl+Shift+A     select all text
  Ctrl+Click       open hovered URL in browser
  Right-Click      open context menu

Drag & drop:
  Drop files from file manager directly into terminal.
(bash's own help: `builtin help`)
H
